# Brand source material — kept locally, never published.
# The repo is public; the FPRA Brand Standards guide is an internal document
# and the .ai is editable source artwork. Neither is needed to build the site
# (only lakechapter-*.svg are imported). See src/assets/brand/README.md.
src/assets/brand/*.pdf
src/assets/brand/*.ai
